        *> <Metadata>
        *> Source Name .........: PROGRAM_NAME
        *> Created By ...........: R. Strauss
        *> Date Created .........: 2026-08-18
        *> Source Description ..: SQL COBOL scaffold for IBM i with SQLSTATE handling.
        *> Jira ..................: N/A
        *> </Metadata>
        *>
        *> <Synopsis>
        *> Reads one row via embedded SQL and handles success/no-data/error states.
        *> </Synopsis>
        *>
        *> <Revision History>
        *> Revisioner | Date | Jira No (if known) | Change |
        *> R. Strauss | 2026-08-28 | N/A | Initial scaffold |
        *> </Revision History>

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PROGRAM_NAME.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-I.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-I.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ID                     PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-NAME                   PIC X(50) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-SQLSTATE               PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.

       EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE-LEG
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT NAME
                INTO :WS-NAME
                FROM TABLE_NAME
               WHERE ID = :WS-ID
               FETCH FIRST 1 ROW ONLY
           END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLSTATE TO WS-SQLSTATE

           EVALUATE TRUE
             WHEN WS-SQLSTATE = '00000'
               DISPLAY 'Read successful.'
             WHEN WS-SQLSTATE = '02000'
               DISPLAY 'No row found.'
             WHEN OTHER
               DISPLAY 'SQL error. SQLSTATE=' WS-SQLSTATE
           END-EVALUATE

           GOBACK.

       INITIALIZE-LEG.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-ID
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-NAME
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-SQLSTATE.

       END PROGRAM PROGRAM_NAME.
